message.content:
EXECUTE IMMEDIATELY. No planning phase. No asking for approval. Just make the changes.

Working dir: `/Users/yashbaldha/Desktop/Boldteq App/InkOS`
Redesign spec: `.handoffs/sprint-14-redesign-spec.md` — READ IT and follow the exact CSS values.

**This is APPROVED. Ship it. Here are the 18 files to modify:**

1. **`app/globals.css`** — Update dark mode tokens so cards are visible (card surface 12%→14% lightness), add surface-1/2/3/elevated vars, add --shadow-glow-card with purple tint, add --shadow-card-hover, add stagger-children utility (40ms steps), shimmer keyframe, FullCalendar dark overrides, sidebar active pill ::before glow replacing border-l-2

2. **`components/ui/card.tsx`** — `bg-card` → `bg-[var(--color-surface-1,var(--color-card))]`, `ring-1 ring-foreground/10` → `border border-border/40`, add `shadow-[var(--shadow-glow-card)]`

3. **`components/shared/KpiCard.tsx`** — REWRITE: drop Card wrapper, custom div with accent gradient stripe at top (1px, color via `accentColor` prop), icon in rounded badge `bg-primary/8 ring-1 ring-primary/15`, value `text-[1.75rem] font-bold tabular-nums`, hover lifts with shadow-card-hover

4. **`components/shared/EmptyState.tsx`** — Layered glow icon: blur halo `bg-primary/6 blur-xl`, icon box `rounded-2xl border-primary/15 bg-primary/8` with purple shadow, icon `text-primary/80`

5. **`app/(auth)/layout.tsx`** — REWRITE to split-screen: left panel (hidden on mobile) with mesh gradient + purple/violet radial glows + logo + 3 feature bullets + social proof, right panel with form. Import CalendarDays, Users, DollarSign from lucide-react.

6. **`components/app/sidebar/AppSidebar.tsx`** — Logo `h-7→h-8 rounded-md`, add `ring-1 ring-primary/20`, brand text bolder

7. **`components/app/sidebar/SidebarNavGroup.tsx`** — Group label `text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground/40`, nav button `h-9 text-[13px] text-sidebar-foreground/70`, icon `!h-[17px] !w-[17px] opacity-60`

8. **`components/app/sidebar/AppHeader.tsx`** — `backdrop-blur-md`, dark translucent bg `bg-[oklch(9.5%_0.02_270_/_0.95)]`, shadow `0 1px 0 0 oklch(22%_0.03_272)`, SidebarTrigger `h-9 w-9 rounded-lg`, main content `bg-[var(--color-page-bg,var(--color-background))]`

9. **`components/shared/PageHeader.tsx`** — Title `text-[1.625rem] font-bold tracking-tight leading-tight`, remove border-l-2, subtitle `text-muted-foreground/70`

10. **`app/(app)/dashboard/DashboardClient.tsx`** — Greeting `text-[2rem]`, studio name small label above, add `accentColor` to each KPI card, `stagger-children` on grid, `max-w-[1600px]`

11. **`components/auth/LoginForm.tsx`** — Heading `text-[1.6rem] leading-tight`, submit button `gap-2 font-semibold`

12. **`components/auth/SignupForm.tsx`** — Same heading + button changes

13. **`app/layout.tsx`** — Toaster: `position="top-right"`, add `toastOptions={{ classNames: { toast: 'rounded-xl backdrop-blur-sm', ... } }}`

14. **`components/calendar/CalendarView.tsx`** — Wrap FullCalendar in `<div className="rounded-xl border border-border/40 overflow-hidden shadow-[var(--shadow-glow-card)]">`

15. **`app/(app)/calendar/_components/CalendarPageClient.tsx`** — Loading skeleton: header row + `h-[60vh]` block

16. **`components/shared/KpiCardSkeleton.tsx`** (if exists) — Match new KpiCard height (110px) + surface-1 bg

17. **`components/app/sidebar/SidebarUserFooter.tsx`** — Role badge `text-primary/80`

18. **`components/ui/button.tsx`** — Default variant: add `hover:shadow-[0_0_16px_oklch(62%_0.24_292_/_0.15)]` for subtle purple glow on hover

**For globals.css changes — here are the KEY values to set in .dark {}:**
```
--color-background: oklch(9% 0.02 270);
--color-card: oklch(14% 0.025 272);     /* was 12% — now visible */
--color-muted: oklch(18% 0.02 270);
--color-border: oklch(22% 0.03 272);
--color-input: oklch(16% 0.025 272);

/* NEW surface levels */
--color-surface-1: oklch(13% 0.025 272);
--color-surface-2: oklch(16% 0.02 270);
--color-surface-3: oklch(19% 0.02 270);
--color-surface-elevated: oklch(22% 0.025 272);
--color-page-bg: oklch(8% 0.015 270);

/* NEW shadows with purple glow */
--shadow-glow-card: 0 1px 3px oklch(0% 0 0 / 0.4), 0 0 0 1px oklch(22% 0.03 272 / 0.5), inset 0 1px 0 oklch(100% 0 0 / 0.03);
--shadow-card-hover: 0 8px 25px oklch(0% 0 0 / 0.5), 0 0 0 1px oklch(62% 0.24 292 / 0.15), inset 0 1px 0 oklch(100% 0 0 / 0.04);
```

**JUST DO IT. Make the edits. Run the gates. Report back.**

Rules: zero `any`, zero `console.log`, base-nova `render` not `asChild`, dark mode only.

Gates at end: `pnpm typecheck && pnpm lint && pnpm build && pnpm test`

